  "body_html": "<p>Elevate your bedroom decor with this custom Viking quilt set from Jeminise, where Norse mythology meets cozy comfort. Featuring a striking digital illustration of a skull and Mjolnir within a circular Celtic knot, this quilt is perfect for adding a touch of bold, mythological style to any guest bedroom or master suite. Crafted from soft polyester and filled with high-quality silk floss, it offers the perfect balance of warmth for chilly nights and breathability for warmer days, making it an excellent choice for year-round use.</p>\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Custom Options:</strong> Easily personalized with your choice of size, optional matching pillowcases, or custom text input such as names of loved ones to create a truly unique bedding set.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Norse Mythology Design:</strong> Features a highly detailed digital illustration showcasing Mjolnir, a skull, ravens, Vegvisir, and intricate Celtic knot details.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Comfort &amp; Warmth:</strong> Made with a breathable polyester outer layer and filled with high-quality silk floss for cozy, lightweight warmth in all seasons.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in a versatile range of sizes including Throw, Twin, Full, Queen, and King to suit various beds, sofas, or outdoor camping needs.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> Set includes one high-quality quilt with optional matching pillowcases available to complete the look.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Conveniently machine washable in cold water, drying quickly to become even fluffier than before.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Silk Floss</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Viking-03</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Tree of Life, Viking</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Viking Decor</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Viking Pattern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw, Twin, Full, Queen, King</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>Text and Pillowcase options supported</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All Season</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
